WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.990
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:16.910
I'm a second-year at the idol middle school, Four Star Academy.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:21.660
As a top idol in S4, I work hard at my Aikatsu every day.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.540
An extravagant cruise liner appeared at the harbor.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.960
That boat is the idol school, Venus Ark.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:35.720
The owner and top idol, Elza-san, is scouting around the world for idols who measure up to her standards.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.970
Yume Nijino.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.220
I've come to plunder you.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.480
Obviously, I don't have any intention of leaving Four Star Academy...

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.940
But I've never seen a coord with wings like hers before.

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:57.320
The world is full of amazing idols!

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:01.830
It feels like a new age of Aikatsu has begun, and I can't contain my excitement!

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.050
So yummy!

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:20.050
What was today's breakfast?

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:22.890
The steak was imported from Texas in the United States. {united states? }

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.190
We also flew the cheese in from Switzerland.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.060
Did it suit your palate?

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.190
Quite well, in fact.

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.440
You honor me.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.940
Shiratori Hime.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.280
How very intriguing.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:42.080
I approve of your decision to dock in Japan just to scout her.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:45.540
She has the potential to become a perfect idol.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:49.250
I will obtain her by any means necessary.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.960
Geez, you already have Kirara, Elza-sama!

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:57.340
I understand Hime, but why scout this girl too?

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:02.600
Nijino Yume. She may stand at the peak of Four Star Academy in S4...

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:06.230
But that's only because Shiratori Hime graduated.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.560
She lost to Hime at the S4 Selection.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.520
I couldn't see any sparklies in her.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.480
Yes, neither could I.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:18.150
What's important is the value Hime places in her.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:21.620
With Yume on Venus Ark, 
Hime will fall right into my hands.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:26.200
I see. You're using her as bait to capture your true prey, Hime.

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.500
As expected of Elza-sama! Your plan is perfect!{I am surprised at your choice of how to translate sasuga}{I'd deliberately making Kirara honky-tonk crazy}

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:35.760
In order to obtain Hime, I will first claim you as my own, Yume Nijino.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:17.570
Venus Ark is a world-renowned idol school, isn't it?

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:21.070
Hime-senpai from the high school's already been scouted.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.900
I heard Yume-senpai was too!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:25.070
So they're headhunting us?

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:28.080
Four Star Academy could be in danger.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.410
Hey, babies! It's time for class.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.920
Sensei, are Yume-senpai and Hime-senpai going to go to Venus Ark?

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.920
What's going to happen to us?

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:45.180
No problem! This isn't enough to even make Four Star Academy flinch.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.430
All you girls need to do is focus on your Aikatsu!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.020
You're killing me, babies.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:58.440
The Four Star Academy student council emergency meeting shall begin.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.070
We've convened to discuss the matter of Venus Ark.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:09.080
The owner, Elza Forte, sails the world looking for top idols to bring aboard her ship.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:12.830
She is the idol pirate who leaves no prey unplundered!{is this really how we're going to it?}{but... plunder. I'm sure there'll be a time we can't, but we can for now}

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:19.840
Shiratori Hime-senpai of our high school and Nijino Yume of S4 are both under pursuit.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:24.800
We simply cannot sit quietly as our students are plucked away!

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.800
Isn't that right, President?!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.300
That gets me going!

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:30.260
It should not get you going!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.640
It's a declaration of war on Four Star Academy!

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.150
We'll take on any fight that comes our way!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.020
President!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.820
It's time for work!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.990
The rest is up to you, Vice President Rola-chan!

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.500
I've got to do something.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.300
How lovely!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:09.890
Yume-senpai, good luck with your work!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.310
Yume-senpai waved at me!

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:21.310
I just can't get used to this sort of thing.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.900
It's part of our work as S4.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.650
Ako-chan, your face is all scrunched up.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.070
Are you still mad at that girl?

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.990
Of course I am!

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:34.330
She snatched my brand right out of my hands!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:39.580
Curse you, Venus Ark's Hanazono Kirara!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:43.000
Now, now. Save it for after our appearance.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:48.550
Nijino-san, you've stated that your dream was to join S4.

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:51.340
How do you feel now that you've accomplished it?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:56.520
Every day I'm reminded of how much further I have to go to live up to my predecessors' legacy.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:00.060
But I'll work hard to quickly catch up and go beyond where they stood!

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.770
All right, finished!

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.820
We finally got through them.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.490
My hand hurts...

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.820
Not even close!

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.160
Bigger smiles!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:18.250
Good, now turn! Look this way.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.250
And a final pose!

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:33.510
Tighten your abs, and sing from your stomach!

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:37.100
Pull your chin in, puff your chest out,

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.770
and open your throat wide!

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.650
Okay, that's enough!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.400
Good morning!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.660
Yume-senpai, good morning!

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.870
You're all working hard.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.950
My legs are shaking!

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:01.410
I can't go on...

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:04.670
My legs hurt...{I mean, but}{just avvin a laugh}

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.880
Yume-senpai, you're incredible!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.300
I don't think we'll ever be able to do that...

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.970
That's not true.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:15.300
Back in my first year, my legs were shaking as much as yours.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.600
What, really?!

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:22.480
Really, really! But keep up with the lessons, and eventually you'll make it here.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.600
Thank you very much!

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.310
Goodbye!

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:29.530
Good work.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.990
Same to you.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:34.240
Yume-san, is something the matter?

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:40.580
Oh, no. I was just wondering if there was 
anything more I could do for the first-years.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.620
Hey, Rola. Why don't we put on a show?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.790
A show?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:49.880
I think a real-life example might get through to them better than just words.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:54.430
An experience they cannot deny. Seeing is believing. {well this is new for her}

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.760
I believe that to be a good idea.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:00.770
But will you be okay? What about all of your other S4 work?

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:05.520
It's a piece of cake! I've been wanting to perform with Rola again for a while.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.060
So have I, actually!

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.030
Where should we start?

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:14.030
How about picking our coords?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.410
Are those designs for a Premium Rare Dress?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:22.290
Yeah, but nothing's really clicking.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.750
It's all well and good that my desire to join S4 and start a brand got fulfilled,

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.960
but I'm not good enough to make full use of it.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.050
Are there any coords or dresses that've caught your eye recently?

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.920
A coord that caught my eye?

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:42.010
That coord with the wings...

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:44.180
I see it really has been on your mind.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:47.560
Yume-san, you have a visitor.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.480
Elza Forte!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:53.030
Lily-senpai, why would you bring someone like her here?

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:59.070
Idols must face all who cross their path with grace and honor, never thinking to run away.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:02.160
It was a Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:06.290
So that's called a Star Premium Rare Coord? {I mean, I know it's Japanese, but come on. you don't need to repeat everything}

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:11.040
Yes, it is a special coord only perfect idols are permitted to wear.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:15.300
Each Star Premium Rare Coord reflects a specific star.{er, right}

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.550
My coord is Venus. {it's "planet" in English, aaahhhhhh}{let's just call them stars for everything, it'll save us headache in the future (also in astrology and stuff they are traditionally considered in the same category as the other stars, or at least distinct from sun and moon anyway)}

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.850
Venus is the brightest star in the sky! {even if it was hoshi, that includes the sun!}{iau only defines scientific use, no one can legislate common usage}

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:24.180
That's how amazing Elza-sama is!

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:26.560
How did you get that coord?

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:33.020
A Star Premium Rare Coord can not be created—
it is bequeathed by the Aikatsu System.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.940
By the Aikatsu System?

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:39.570
A peerless Premium Rare Dress and a perfect idol.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:44.950
When both grace the stage at once, star wings will be granted.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:50.210
Star wings... a Star Premium Rare Coord!

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:55.380
"I want one too."

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.210
Is that not what you are thinking?

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:04.100
Come to Venus Ark. I'll give you what you desire.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.100
Yume already told you she wasn't going!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:13.810
I have no interest in those without even a brand to their name.

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:14.900
Stand down.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:18.900
Have you ever seen Rola perform?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:22.570
No, but I can determine her abilities at a glance.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:26.540
Top-class idols emit an aura with their very presence.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.910
I do not sense the slightest hint of one from her.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.840
If you wish to be top-class, I suggest you come to Venus Ark—

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.210
I will not go!

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.260
Why?

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:42.130
There's something wrong with judging a person's ability without seeing them perform.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.090
More importantly...

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:48.350
Rola is my precious friend and rival.

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:52.850
I'll never go along with someone who would insult her!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.730
Yume!

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:00.990
Please leave. We have to prepare for our show.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:03.910
Hey! You can't talk to Elza-sama like—

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.620
We'll leave for now.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:17.210
Yume Nijino. Your performance had better impress. {you can talk the talk but can you walk the walk/ let's see you put your money where your mouth is}{why do you must do this}{can't change how my brain works}

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.760
Baa! {I really just need to do this to prove we understand she's a sheep, otherwise I'd skip}{fine}

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:37.520
It's been forever since I saw Yume-chan and Rola-chan together!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.440
I can't wait to hear Yume-chan sing!

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:43.280
I'm on the edge of my seat waiting to see Rola-chan dance!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.790
She's so pretty. Who is that?

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:54.670
You don't know? It's Elza Forte, from Venus Ark!

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:57.670
Why is she at Four Star Academy?

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:03.470
<i>She converted Nijino and Sakuraba's fans in the blink of an eye.</i>

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:07.050
<i>Perfect Elza is to be feared.</i>

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.810
She's here, that Elza Forte.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.270
I won't let her have her way with our school!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:19.360
We have to put our strength on display!

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.400
I think that'll take care of itself.

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:26.990
The most important thing is to show our fans a good time!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.070
Yume...

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.950
Let's light the way for the first-years!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.170
You're part of S4 now, Yume.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:45.420
H-Hey...

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.630
Your abs are rock-hard too.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:52.100
You haven't let up on your basic training at all this past year.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:56.100
Early every morning and whenever you 
had time, you've been training in secret.

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:01.230
You're not even the least bit winded after a full performance.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.610
Rola...

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:08.820
Okay! Let's enjoy our first show together in a while along with the fans!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.280
Yeah.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:14.700
I've thought about it a lot, and I think we should go with these dresses today.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.250
The school dresses!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:25.010
Showing the first-years how amazing you can be in the same dresses they wear should have a real impact.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:30.140
The Blue Marching Coord. 
The no-sleeve top adds a cool flair!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.760
And mine is...

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.100
The Pink Marching Coord.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:39.060
The mature vest and showy gold make it stand out.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:43.860
Sakuraba Rola—It's our time to shine!

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.530
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:18.450
Yume-senpai and Rola-senpai are amazing!

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:22.700
I didn't know you could hold such an awesome show in the same school dresses we wear!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:27.460
It just goes to show how far you can get if you keep up your Aikatsu!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.710
We can be like them?

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.170
Let's Aikatsu hard!

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:32.090
Yeah!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:42.760
I was surprised. She's typically unremarkable, yet on the stage, she's radiant.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.600
Yume truly is an intriguing idol.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.350
Kirara saw a couple of sparklies in her too.

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.690
You mustn't forget that Rola girl.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.980
Her singing prowess is not to be underestimated.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:00.740
I thought it was only Hime Shiratori,

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:07.790
but Four Star Academy might just be hiding other promising idols like Yume and Rola.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.370
I'm getting excited.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.710
This is Nijino Yume. I'm coming in.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.800
Hello, Yume-chan!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.550
Hime-senpai!

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:25.140
Why are you here?

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:28.810
She came to say her farewells.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:30.310
Farewells?

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:34.770
I'm taking a leave of absence from Four Star to travel the world.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.820
What?! For how long?

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.570
When will we meet again?

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.570
I can't say for certain.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.570
No way, why?

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.080
I understood after seeing Elza-chan.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:52.330
That there was something I was lacking.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.170
I'm going to go find it.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.000
I don't know what to do.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:01.720
I may have joined S4, but I'm still unpolished.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:05.600
There's so much more I wanted to learn from you!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:09.720
You'll be fine. You have all your friends here with you.{this should finer at least}

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:10.980
But...

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:15.360
Oh, and I heard that you gave Elza-chan a real earful.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:19.860
Th-That was because she was mean to Rola, so I couldn't...

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:25.120
It takes real guts to talk back to Perfect Elza.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:29.240
Yume-chan, you've already more than earned your place in S4.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:31.000
Hime-senpai.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.870
I leave Four Star Academy in your hands.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.670
See you again someday.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.470
Yes. Take care, Hime-senpai.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.980
<i>Even Hime-senpai feels she's lacking something.</i>

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.730
<i>That means I need to work even harder.</i>

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.480
<i>But... what should I do?</i>

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:06.410
Yume, you are still lacking something.

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:09.030
And what is that?

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:11.790
Come with me if you wish to know.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:15.790
We will go together and see the Aikatsu of a new world!

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:24.880
The Aikatsu of a new world! I can't contain my excitement! {please say this less}{but it's such an easy translation}

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.470
I'll never, ever go to Venus Ark!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:32.470
Not in a million years!

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:38.440
Get it together, Nijino Yume! 
Stop thinking selfish thoughts!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:42.190
You have responsibilities as S4!

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:46.150
I have... responsibilities...

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:03.380
Welcome back, Elza-sama. What did you think?

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:05.470
It was fairly enjoyable.

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:09.840
Four Star Academy houses idols with hidden potential.

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:13.970
It was just as you said, Koharu.

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:23.400
Yume-chan.

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:59.790
New school dresses! I can't contain my excitement!

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:04.290
Your Pink Marching Coord is great!

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:06.920
Yours was wonderful too!

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:09.420
Rola, let's keep at it together!

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:11.880
Abracadabra!

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:13.680
Huh? It's not opening!

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:16.810
The time to use this spell has come at last!

00:24:16.810 --> 00:24:18.850
